id: pm-5bsofk
title: "GH-1218: expose local package copy scope and packed-install alternatives"
description: Expose a bounded machine-readable local-directory copy-cost plan and a verified packed-install alternative without silently changing directory snapshot semantics.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
