acceptance_criteria: "SDK and CLI local-source planning identifies directory versus archive source and bounded file/byte estimates before copying; large development trees receive a working npm pack and archive-install suggestion; preserve directory snapshots, ignored scripts, dependency resolution, containment and exact host SDK linking; real isolated directory and archive acceptance covers the published consumer flow."
parent: pm-ugqx
risk: medium
confidence: high
reporter: github
severity: medium
resolution: "Implemented bounded SDK directory-copy planning, shared containment exclusions, source-mode receipts, script-free packed alternatives, and CLI/MCP install dry-run with truthful single, multi-target and bundled counts."
expected_result: Agents can inspect local install cost before destination writes and execute a verified packed alternative while preserving existing snapshot and archive safety.
actual_result: "All 8579 tests passed at exact 100/100/100/100. Both linked package suites passed. Real npm and Bun installed consumers planned without destination mutation, packed and activated archives, and exercised exported SDK planning; npx and bunx resolved the installed artifact. All static gate components passed; startup timing passed on an idle rerun after a contention-only failure. Docstrings are 100 percent. Hosted review and merge verification follow this reviewed closure."
